      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW WARRINGAH (6) goes very well over this track and trip including two wins. Comes off a (22.93) win last time, scoring by 2.25 lengths in a Rank Limit - Grade 6 over 400m at Geelong. Makes strong appeal on best. STREET SIXTY SIX (8) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (22.88) in a Grade 5 at this track. Should play a prominent role. PAY UP SALLY (4) was below best at her last start when 7th at Geelong following a third place finish (31.34) at The Meadows two back. Form here at this distance is sound. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Can do much better this time. WILD REBEL (1) will have admirers after placing last time out.",
